cgprofile

Third-party and vendored code
-----------------------------

src/cgprofile/_damon/damon_analysis.py
  Vendored byte copy of scripts/damon-analysis/lib/damon_analysis.py
  (DAMON sysfs control and hot/warm/cold classification).
  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only (as carried in the file's header,
  which is kept unchanged).
  The copy is kept equal to its source by tests/test_damon_vendor.py.

Open licence question
---------------------

The rest of the project declares no licence of its own, and sibling estate
projects declare MIT. Whether a GPL-2.0-only module may ship inside the
cgprofile wheel, be split into an optional extra, or be rewritten is undecided
and tracked as backlog item CP-51 (nyxloom-trove/backlog). Until that is
decided, no licence field is set in pyproject.toml.
